        <mxCell id="story-P01" value="&lt;b&gt;S01 - See my connections&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a user, I can see every saved connection in Settings, including its type, method, account when verified and current status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;S04 - Personal and work accounts can be separate rows of the same type. Choosing a row never changes another account.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Variants&lt;/b&gt;: Loading shows progress; empty shows &quot;No providers connected&quot; + Add provider; read error shows &quot;Could not load providers&quot; + Retry. A read failure never implies an empty list." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#d0d7de;fontColor=#182230;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
