        <mxCell id="story-P02" value="&lt;b&gt;S02 · Choose provider type&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a user, I choose Codex, Claude or OpenCode when adding a connection, before any sign-in starts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type cards name the runtime integration. Choose one, then Continue. Back preserves existing connections. No host credentials are scanned or imported." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#d0d7de;fontColor=#182230;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
